<Base title="About Heimdall" description="What Heimdall is, its licence, its alpha status and how to report a security problem." current="">
  <div class="wrap hero"><div class="eyebrow">About</div><h1>Heimdall</h1>
    <p class="lede">An open-source home network sentinel, named for the Norse watchman who guards the bridge to Asgard. MIT licensed.</p>
    <div class="callout caution"><strong>Alpha</strong>Heimdall has been built and tested on one home network. It can block devices. Read <a href="/security/limits/">the documented limits</a> before relying on it.</div>
    <h2>Reporting a security problem</h2>
    <p>Please follow <a href="https://github.com/danielonet/heimdall/blob/main/SECURITY.md">SECURITY.md</a> rather than opening a public issue.</p>
    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p class="muted">Static pages, no cookies, no analytics, no third-party requests. Fonts are served from this site. The equipment table is generated from the same catalog the software uses.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
